{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard and a $100 loan from a very shady lender. Is that all you\u2019ll need to launch your empire and get filthy rich?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and <i>invest</i> in a questionable workforce \u2014 from panhandlers and crypto miners to stray cats with ambition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the stock market... or gamble your fortune in <i>less conventional</i> ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge documents, dodge taxes, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead. Ethics are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your company! Grow your tiny shack into a ridiculous corporate powerhouse with more money than morals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>jaw-droppingly realistic</strong> graphics, get a taste of what it's like to be a ruthless, exploitative entrepreneur in this game that scored a perfect 10 according to my grandma, Gigi.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822840?t=1753451676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822840?t=1753451676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822840/d45fc4fd090d0e85c43eb1cc11dd14cb6f6303d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753451676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822840/d45fc4fd090d0e85c43eb1cc11dd14cb6f6303d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753451676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Capitalist Misadventures, you start off with a crumbling shack in your grandpa\u2019s backyard and a $100 loan from a very shady lender. Is that all you\u2019ll need to launch your empire and get filthy rich?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and <i>invest</i> in a questionable workforce \u2014 from panhandlers and crypto miners to stray cats with ambition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the stock market... or gamble your fortune in <i>less conventional</i> ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge documents, dodge taxes, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead. Ethics are optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your company! Grow your tiny shack into a ridiculous corporate powerhouse with more money than morals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>jaw-droppingly realistic</strong> graphics, get a taste of what it's like to be a ruthless, exploitative entrepreneur in this game that scored a perfect 10 according to my grandma, Gigi.</p>","developers":["Caramelo Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822840/579b0c00b1ea3256803c8b71b97e7b67b00a7cc5/header.jpg?t=1753451676","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3822840/2063295769/deb55600e6a90983de76ffe38e05132ca6268e46/1753068757/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753071477","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3822840/2063295769/deb55600e6a90983de76ffe38e05132ca6268e46/1753068757/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753071477","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3822840/2063295769/deb55600e6a90983de76ffe38e05132ca6268e46/1753068757/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753071477","id":257171677,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171677/movie480.mp4?t=1753071477","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto